  ('17187', 'Derby', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Cocktail glass', 'Unforgettables', '{Classic,IBA}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/52weey1606772672.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bYQTTokGkFI', 'Pour all ingredients into a mixing glass with ice. Stir. Strain into a cocktail glass. Garnish with a sprig of fresh mint in the drink.', 'Vierta todos los ingredientes en un vaso mezclador con hielo. Remover. Colar en una copa de cóctel. Decorar la copa con una ramita de menta fresca.', '[{"name": "gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/gin-small.png", "measure": "6 cl"}, {"name": "Peach Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Peach%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "2 dashes"}, {"name": "Mint", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Mint-small.png", "measure": "2 Fresh leaves"}]'::jsonb),
