  ('17189', 'Monkey Gland', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Cocktail glass', 'Unforgettables', '{IBA,Classic}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/94psp81504350690.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rWxo9gsddXQ', 'Shake well over ice cubes in a shaker, strain into a chilled cocktail glass.', 'Agitar bien con cubitos de hielo en una coctelera, colar en una copa de cóctel fría.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Benedictine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Benedictine-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Orange juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Grenadine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grenadine-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}]'::jsonb),
