  ('17191', 'Planter''s Punch', 'Punch / Party Drink', true, 'Collins glass', 'Unforgettables', '{IBA,Classic}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/fdk8a31606854815.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oH7PP_lV6J8', 'Pour all ingredients, except the bitters, into shaker filled with ice. Shake well. Pour into large glass, filled with ice. Add Angostura bitters, "on top". Garnish with cocktail cherry and pineapple.', 'Vierta todos los ingredientes, excepto el amargo, en una coctelera llena de hielo. Agitar bien. Verter en un vaso grande, lleno de hielo. Añada el amargo de Angostura "por encima". Decorar con cereza de cóctel y piña.', '[{"name": "Dark rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dark%20rum-small.png", "measure": "1 part"}, {"name": "Orgeat syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orgeat%20syrup-small.png", "measure": "1/2 part"}, {"name": "Orange juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20juice-small.png", "measure": "2 parts"}, {"name": "Pineapple juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Pineapple%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1 part"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17192', 'Porto flip', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Cocktail glass', 'Unforgettables', '{IBA,Classic}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/64x5j41504351518.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2jtoa_t7g94', 'Shake ingredients together in a mixer with ice. Strain into glass, garnish and serve.', 'Agite los ingredientes en una batidora con hielo. Colar en vaso, decorar y servir.', '[{"name": "Brandy", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Brandy-small.png", "measure": "3 parts"}, {"name": "Port", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Port-small.png", "measure": "9 parts"}, {"name": "Egg Yolk", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Egg%20Yolk-small.png", "measure": "2 parts"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17193', 'Stinger', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Cocktail glass', 'Unforgettables', '{IBA,Classic}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/2ahv791504352433.jpg', NULL, 'Pour in a mixing glass with ice, stir and strain into a cocktail glass. May also be served on rocks in a rocks glass.', 'Vierta en un vaso mezclador con hielo, revuelva y cuele en una copa de cóctel. También se puede servir con hielo en un vaso bajo.', '[{"name": "Brandy", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Brandy-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "White Creme de Menthe", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/White%20Creme%20de%20Menthe-small.png", "measure": "1/2 oz"}]'::jsonb),
