  ('17196', 'Cosmopolitan', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', 'Contemporary Classics', '{IBA,ContemporaryClassic}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/kpsajh1504368362.jpg', NULL, 'Add all ingredients into cocktail shaker filled with ice. Shake well and double strain into large cocktail glass. Garnish with lime wheel.', 'Añada todos los ingredientes en una coctelera llena de hielo. Agite bien y cuele dos veces en una copa de cóctel grande. Decorar con una rueda de lima.', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "1 1/4 oz"}, {"name": "Lime juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1/4 oz"}, {"name": "Cointreau", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cointreau-small.png", "measure": "1/4 oz"}, {"name": "Cranberry juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cranberry%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1/4 cup"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17197', 'French 75', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Collins glass', 'Contemporary Classics', '{IBA,ContemporaryClassic}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/hrxfbl1606773109.jpg', NULL, 'Combine gin, sugar, and lemon juice in a cocktail shaker filled with ice. Shake vigorously and strain into a chilled champagne glass. Top up with Champagne. Stir gently.', 'Mezcle la ginebra, el azúcar y el zumo de limón en una coctelera llena de hielo. Agitar enérgicamente y colar en una copa de champán fría. Completar con champán. Remover suavemente.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Sugar", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar-small.png", "measure": "2 tsp superfine"}, {"name": "Lemon juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Champagne", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Champagne-small.png", "measure": "4 oz Chilled"}, {"name": "Orange", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange-small.png", "measure": "1"}, {"name": "Maraschino cherry", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Maraschino%20cherry-small.png", "measure": "1"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17198', 'French Connection', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Old-fashioned glass', 'Contemporary Classics', '{IBA,ContemporaryClassic}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/zaqa381504368758.jpg', NULL, 'Pour all ingredients directly into old fashioned glass filled with ice cubes. Stir gently.', 'Vierta todos los ingredientes directamente en un vaso old fashioned lleno de cubitos de hielo. Remover suavemente.', '[{"name": "Cognac", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cognac-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Amaretto", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Amaretto-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17200', 'Grasshopper', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Cocktail glass', 'Contemporary Classics', '{IBA,ContemporaryClassic,Halloween}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/aqm9el1504369613.jpg', NULL, 'Pour ingredients into a cocktail shaker with ice. Shake briskly and then strain into a chilled cocktail glass.', 'Vierta los ingredientes en una coctelera con hielo. Agitar enérgicamente y colar en una copa de cóctel fría.', '[{"name": "Green Creme de Menthe", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Green%20Creme%20de%20Menthe-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}, {"name": "Creme de Cacao", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Creme%20de%20Cacao-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz white"}, {"name": "Light cream", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Light%20cream-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}]'::jsonb),
