  ('17206', 'Mint Julep', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Collins glass', NULL, '{IBA,ContemporaryClassic}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/squyyq1439907312.jpg', NULL, 'In a highball glass gently muddle the mint, sugar and water. Fill the glass with cracked ice, add Bourbon and stir well until the glass is well frosted. Garnish with a mint sprig.', 'En un vaso highball, mezclar suavemente la menta, el azúcar y el agua. Llenar el vaso con hielo picado, añadir Bourbon y remover bien hasta que el vaso esté bien escarchado. Decorar con una ramita de menta.', '[{"name": "Mint", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Mint-small.png", "measure": "4 fresh"}, {"name": "Bourbon", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Bourbon-small.png", "measure": "2 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Powdered sugar", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Powdered%20sugar-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Water-small.png", "measure": "2 tsp"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17207', 'Pina Colada', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Collins glass', 'Contemporary Classics', '{IBA,ContemporaryClassic}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/upgsue1668419912.jpg', NULL, 'Mix with crushed ice in blender until smooth. Pour into chilled glass, garnish and serve.', 'Mezclar con hielo picado en la batidora hasta obtener una mezcla homogénea. Verter en un vaso frío, decorar y servir.', '[{"name": "Light rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Light%20rum-small.png", "measure": "3 oz"}, {"name": "Coconut milk", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Coconut%20milk-small.png", "measure": "3 tblsp"}, {"name": "Pineapple", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Pineapple-small.png", "measure": "3 tblsp"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17208', 'Rose', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Cocktail glass', 'Contemporary Classics', '{IBA,ContemporaryClassic}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/8kxbvq1504371462.jpg', NULL, 'Shake together in a cocktail shaker, then strain into chilled glass. Garnish and serve.', 'Agite en una coctelera y luego cuele en un vaso frío. Adorne y sirva.', '[{"name": "Dry Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dry%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Apricot brandy", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Apricot%20brandy-small.png", "measure": "1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Lemon juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1/2 tsp"}, {"name": "Grenadine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grenadine-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Powdered sugar", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Powdered%20sugar-small.png", "measure": null}]'::jsonb),
  ('17209', 'Barracuda', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Margarita glass', 'New Era Drinks', '{IBA,NewEra}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/jwmr1x1504372337.jpg', NULL, 'Shake pour ingredients with ice. Strain into glass, top with Sparkling wine.', 'Agitar los ingredientes con hielo. Colar en un vaso y completar con vino espumoso.', '[{"name": "Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rum-small.png", "measure": "4.5 cl"}, {"name": "Galliano", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Galliano-small.png", "measure": "1.5 cl"}, {"name": "Pineapple Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Pineapple%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "6 cl"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1 dash"}, {"name": "Prosecco", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Prosecco-small.png", "measure": "top up"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17210', 'Bramble', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Old-Fashioned glass', 'New Era Drinks', '{IBA,NewEra}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/twtbh51630406392.jpg', NULL, 'Fill glass with crushed ice. Build gin, lemon juice and simple syrup over. Stir, and then pour blackberry liqueur over in a circular fashion to create marbling effect. Garnish with two blackberries and lemon slice.', 'Llenar el vaso con hielo picado. Echar por encima la ginebra, el zumo de limón y el sirope simple. Remover y, a continuación, verter el licor de mora en forma circular para crear un efecto marmolado. Decorar con dos moras y una rodaja de limón.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "4 cl"}, {"name": "lemon juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/lemon%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1.5 cl"}, {"name": "Sugar syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar%20syrup-small.png", "measure": "1 cl"}, {"name": "Creme de Mure", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Creme%20de%20Mure-small.png", "measure": "1.5 cl"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17211', 'Dark and Stormy', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Highball glass', 'New Era Drinks', '{IBA,NewEra}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/t1tn0s1504374905.jpg', NULL, 'In a highball glass filled with ice add 6cl dark rum and top with ginger beer. Garnish with lime wedge.', 'En un vaso highball lleno de hielo, añadir 6 cl de ron oscuro y completar con cerveza de jengibre. Decorar con una rodaja de lima.', '[{"name": "Dark Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dark%20Rum-small.png", "measure": "5 cl"}, {"name": "Ginger Beer", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ginger%20Beer-small.png", "measure": "10 cl"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17212', 'Espresso Martini', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', 'New Era Drinks', '{IBA,NewEra}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/n0sx531504372951.jpg', NULL, 'Pour ingredients into shaker filled with ice, shake vigorously, and strain into chilled martini glass', 'Vierte los ingredientes en una coctelera llena de hielo, agita enérgicamente y cuela en una copa de martini fría', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "5 cl"}, {"name": "Kahlua", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Kahlua-small.png", "measure": "1 cl"}, {"name": "Sugar syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar%20syrup-small.png", "measure": "1 dash"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17213', 'French Martini', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', 'New Era Drinks', '{NewEra,IBA}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/clth721504373134.jpg', NULL, 'Pour all ingredients into shaker with ice cubes. Shake well and strain into a chilled cocktail glass. Squeeze oil from lemon peel onto the drink.', 'Vierta todos los ingredientes en una coctelera con cubitos de hielo. Agitar bien y colar en una copa de cóctel fría. Exprima el aceite de la cáscara de limón sobre la bebida.', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "4.5 cl"}, {"name": "Raspberry Liqueur", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Raspberry%20Liqueur-small.png", "measure": "1.5 cl"}, {"name": "pineapple juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/pineapple%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1.5 cl"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17214', 'Russian Spring Punch', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Highball glass', 'New Era Drinks', '{IBA,NewEra}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/ctt20s1504373488.jpg', NULL, 'Pour the ingredients into an highball glass, top with Sparkling wine.', 'Vierta los ingredientes en un vaso alto y cubra con vino espumoso.', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "2.5 cl"}, {"name": "Creme de Cassis", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Creme%20de%20Cassis-small.png", "measure": "1.5 cl"}, {"name": "Sugar Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "1 cl"}, {"name": "Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "2.5 cl"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17215', 'Spritz', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Old-Fashioned glass', 'New Era Drinks', '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/j9evx11504373665.jpg', NULL, 'Build into glass over ice, garnish and serve.', 'Servir en un vaso con hielo, decorar y servir.', '[{"name": "Prosecco", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Prosecco-small.png", "measure": "6 cl"}, {"name": "Campari", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Campari-small.png", "measure": "4 cl"}, {"name": "Soda Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soda%20Water-small.png", "measure": "splash"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17217', 'Vampiro', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Old-Fashioned glass', 'New Era Drinks', '{IBA,NewEra}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/yfhn371504374246.jpg', NULL, 'Vampiros may be made in a tall glass or an old fashioned glass. Bartenders may first "rim" the glass with Kosher Salt, which is done by placing a layer of Kosher Salt on a chopping board, moistening the glass'' rim with lime juice or water, and then placing the upside down glass rim onto the Kosher Salt, so that the salt sticks to the moistened rim. The second step is to fill half the glass with ice and add one or two shooter glasses full of high quality Tequila. The next stage is to add the flavouring elements. This is done by squeezing a fresh lime into the glass, adding a few grains of salt, adding citrus-flavoured soda pop, until the glass is 4/5 full, and then adding spicy Viuda de Sanchez (or orange juice, lime juice and pico de gallo). The final step is to stir the ingredients so that the flavours are properly blended.', 'Los vampiros pueden prepararse en un vaso alto o en un vaso old fashioned. En primer lugar, los camareros pueden "poner el borde" del vaso con sal Kosher, lo que se hace colocando una capa de sal Kosher sobre una tabla de cortar, humedeciendo el borde del vaso con zumo de lima o agua y colocando el borde del vaso boca abajo sobre la sal Kosher, de modo que la sal se pegue al borde humedecido. El segundo paso es llenar la mitad del vaso con hielo y añadir uno o dos vasos llenos de tequila de alta calidad. El siguiente paso es añadir los elementos aromatizantes. Para ello, se exprime una lima fresca en el vaso, se añaden unos granos de sal, se añade gaseosa con sabor a cítricos hasta que el vaso esté 4/5 lleno y, a continuación, se añade Viuda de Sánchez picante (o zumo de naranja, zumo de lima y pico de gallo). El último paso es remover los ingredientes para que se mezclen bien los sabores.', '[{"name": "Tequila", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tequila-small.png", "measure": "6 cl"}, {"name": "Tomato Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tomato%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "3 cl"}, {"name": "Orange Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "3 cl"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1.5 cl"}, {"name": "Sugar Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "1 dash"}, {"name": "Salt", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Salt-small.png", "measure": "1 pinch"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17218', 'Vesper', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', 'New Era Drinks', '{IBA,NewEra}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/mtdxpa1504374514.jpg', NULL, 'Shake over ice until well chilled, then strain into a deep goblet and garnish with a thin slice of lemon peel.', 'Agite sobre hielo hasta que esté bien frío, luego cuele en una copa honda y decore con una rodaja fina de cáscara de limón.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "6 cl"}, {"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "1.5 cl"}, {"name": "Lillet Blanc", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lillet%20Blanc-small.png", "measure": "0.75 cl"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17219', 'Yellow Bird', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', 'New Era Drinks', '{IBA,NewEra}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/2t9r6w1504374811.jpg', NULL, 'Shake and strain into a chilled cocktail glass', 'Agitar y colar en una copa de cóctel fría.', '[{"name": "White Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/White%20Rum-small.png", "measure": "3 cl"}, {"name": "Galliano", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Galliano-small.png", "measure": "1.5 cl"}, {"name": "Triple Sec", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Triple%20Sec-small.png", "measure": "1.5 cl"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1.5 cl"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17222', 'A1', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/2x8thr1504816928.jpg', NULL, 'Pour all ingredients into a cocktail shaker, mix and serve over ice into a chilled glass.', 'Verter todos los ingredientes en una coctelera, mezclar y servir con hielo en una copa fría.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 3/4 shot"}, {"name": "Grand Marnier", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grand%20Marnier-small.png", "measure": "1 Shot"}, {"name": "Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1/4 Shot"}, {"name": "Grenadine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grenadine-small.png", "measure": "1/8 Shot"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17225', 'Ace', 'Cocktail', true, 'Martini Glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/l3cd7f1504818306.jpg', NULL, 'Shake all the ingredients in a cocktail shaker and ice then strain in a cold glass.', 'Agitar todos los ingredientes en una coctelera con hielo y colar en un vaso frío.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "2 shots"}, {"name": "Grenadine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grenadine-small.png", "measure": "1/2 shot"}, {"name": "Heavy cream", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Heavy%20cream-small.png", "measure": "1/2 shot"}, {"name": "Milk", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Milk-small.png", "measure": "1/2 shot"}, {"name": "Egg White", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Egg%20White-small.png", "measure": "1/2 Fresh"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17227', 'Addington', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/ib0b7g1504818925.jpg', NULL, 'Mix both the vermouth''s in a shaker and strain into a cold glass. Top up with a squirt of Soda Water.', 'Mezcle ambos vermuts en una coctelera y cuélelos en un vaso frío. Completar con un chorrito de soda.', '[{"name": "Sweet Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sweet%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "2 shots"}, {"name": "Dry Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dry%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Soda Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soda%20Water-small.png", "measure": "Top up with"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17228', 'Addison', 'Cocktail', true, 'Martini Glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/yzva7x1504820300.jpg', NULL, 'Shake together all the ingredients and strain into a cold glass.', 'Agite todos los ingredientes y cuélelos en un vaso frío.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 shot"}, {"name": "Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 shot"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17230', 'Gin Rickey', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/s00d6f1504883945.jpg', NULL, 'Half-fill a tall glass with ice. Mix the gin and Grenadine together and pour over the ice. Add the lime or lemon juice and top off with soda water. Decorate the glass with lime and/or lemon slices.', 'Llene hasta la mitad un vaso alto con hielo. Mezcle la ginebra y la granadina y viértalo sobre el hielo. Añada el zumo de lima o limón y complete con soda. Decore el vaso con rodajas de lima y/o limón.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Grenadine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grenadine-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "lemon", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/lemon-small.png", "measure": "Juice of 1/2"}, {"name": "Soda Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soda%20Water-small.png", "measure": "Top up with"}, {"name": "Lime", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime-small.png", "measure": "Garnish"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17239', 'Hunter''s Moon', 'Cocktail', true, 'Balloon Glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/t0iugg1509556712.jpg', NULL, 'Put the Bombay Sapphire, Martini Bianco, sugar syrup & blackberries in a cocktail shaker with lots of ice and shake vigorously before pouring into a balloon glass, topping up with lemonade and garnishing with a wedge of orange.', 'Ponga el Bombay Sapphire, el Martini Bianco, el sirope de azúcar y las moras en una coctelera con mucho hielo y agite enérgicamente antes de verter en una copa globo, completar con limonada y decorar con un gajo de naranja.', '[{"name": "Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "25 ml"}, {"name": "Maraschino Cherry", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Maraschino%20Cherry-small.png", "measure": "15 ml"}, {"name": "Sugar Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "10 ml"}, {"name": "Lemonade", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemonade-small.png", "measure": "100 ml"}, {"name": "Blackberries", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Blackberries-small.png", "measure": "2"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17241', 'Zombie', 'Cocktail', true, 'Hurricane glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/2en3jk1509557725.jpg', NULL, 'Blend at high speed for no more than 5 seconds.

Pour into a glass, add ice cubes to fill, then add the garnish.

*Donn’s mix: Bring 3 crushed cinnamon sticks, 1 cup of sugar and 1 cup of water to a boil, stirring until the sugar is dissolved.

Simmer for 2 minutes, then remove from the heat and let sit for at least 2 hours before straining into a clean glass bottle.

Then add 1 part of the syrup and 2 parts of fresh grapefruit juice together.', 'Licue a alta velocidad durante no más de 5 segundos.

Vierta en un vaso, agregue cubitos de hielo para llenar y luego agregue la guarnición.

*Mezcla de Donn: hierva 3 ramas de canela trituradas, 1 taza de azúcar y 1 taza de agua, revolviendo hasta que el azúcar se disuelva.

Cocine a fuego lento durante 2 minutos, luego retírelo del fuego y déjelo reposar durante al menos 2 horas antes de colarlo en una botella de vidrio limpia.

Luego agregue 1 parte de almíbar y 2 partes de jugo de pomelo fresco.', '[{"name": "Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rum-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Gold rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gold%20rum-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "151 proof rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/151%20proof%20rum-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Pernod", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Pernod-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Grenadine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grenadine-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Angostura Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Angostura%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "1 drop"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17245', 'Rosemary Blue', 'Cocktail', true, 'Balloon Glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/qwc5f91512406543.jpg', NULL, '1) Add the Bombay Sapphire, Blue Curacao, rosemary sprig and gently squeezed lemon wedge to a balloon glass. Swirl well to combine.
2) Fill with cubed ice and top with the Fever-Tree Light Tonic Water.
3) Gently fold with a bar spoon to mix.', '1) Agregue Bombay Sapphire, Blue Curacao, una ramita de romero y una rodaja de limón suavemente exprimida a una copa tipo globo. Agite bien para combinar.
2) Llénelo con cubitos de hielo y cubra con el agua tónica ligera Fever-Tree.
3) Incorporar suavemente con una cuchara de bar para mezclar.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "50 ml"}, {"name": "Blue Curacao", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Blue%20Curacao-small.png", "measure": "15 ml"}, {"name": "Tonic Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tonic%20Water-small.png", "measure": "100 ml"}, {"name": "Rosemary", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rosemary-small.png", "measure": "Garnish with"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17246', 'Empellón Cocina''s Fat-Washed Mezcal', 'Cocktail', true, 'Beer Glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/osgvxt1513595509.jpg', NULL, 'To ensure that your pork fat is just as delicious as theirs, here’s their adobo marinade and what to do with it (you’ll also need a rack of ribs):

4 ancho chiles, 8 guajillo chiles and 4 chipotle chiles, plus 4 cloves roasted garlic, half a cup of cider vinegar, a quarter teaspoon of Mexican oregano, 1 teaspoon of ground black pepper, a whole clove, a quarter teaspoon of ground cinnamon and a half teaspoon of ground cumin.

Toast the dried chiles and soak in water for at least an hour until they are rehydrated. Drain and discard the soaking liquid. Combine the soaked chiles with the remaining ingredients and purée until smooth.

Cold smoke a rack of baby back pork ribs by taking a large hotel pan with woodchips on one side and charcoal on the other. Place another, smaller, pan with pork ribs, above the charcoal/woodchip pan. Ignite the charcoal, being careful to not ignite the woodchips. Cover both pans with foil and allow to smoke for 10-15 minutes, until desired level of smoke is achieved, then coat with adobo marinade and wrap in tin foil prior to placing ribs in a 300 degree oven for 7 hours. When the ribs have cooled, strain off the fat and use for the infusion.

If you’re having a hard time coming up to the same kind of volume of fat, make up the balance with pork lard from a butcher. To get the same depth of flavor without the ribs, heat up the fat in a pot with a few spoons of the marinade.

Once you’ve got your tub of seasoned pork fat in cooled liquid form, pour equal amounts of Ilegal Joven mezcal and fat into a sealable container. Seal the container and give it a really good shake, then put it in the freezer overnight. When the whole thing is separated and congealed, pour it through a fine mesh chinoise. If you don’t have a chinoise, try a fine mesh strainer, or if you don’t have one of those, try spooning off most of the fat. There will be some beads of orange fat left in the strained mezcal: run that through a few layers of cheesecloth (or coffee filters in a pinch) to get rid of the last of it.

The mezcal is now ready for drinking, straight-up or in a cocktail. 

Habanero tincture

Slice habaneros and add 2 ounces Ilegal Joven mezcal.
Allow to sit overnight or until desired level of heat is achieved.
Cocktail

Combine mezcal and chocolate liqueur in a mixing glass with ice and stir for 45 seconds.
Strain into chilled coupe.
Carefully "sink" the coffee liqueur down the inside of the coupe over a spoon.
Garnish with 5 drops habanero tincture.', 'Para que tu grasa de cerdo sea tan deliciosa como la suya, aquí tienes su adobo y qué hacer con él (también necesitarás un costillar):

4 chiles anchos, 8 chiles guajillos y 4 chiles chipotles, más 4 dientes de ajo asado, media taza de vinagre de sidra, un cuarto de cucharadita de orégano mexicano, 1 cucharadita de pimienta negra molida, un clavo entero, un cuarto de cucharadita de canela molida y media cucharadita de comino molido.

Tostar los chiles secos y remojarlos en agua durante al menos una hora hasta que se rehidraten. Escurrir y desechar el líquido de remojo. Mezclar los chiles remojados con el resto de ingredientes y hacer un puré hasta que quede suave.

Ahumar en frío un costillar de cerdo en una sartén grande con astillas de madera en un lado y carbón en el otro. Coloca otra sartén más pequeña con costillas de cerdo encima de la sartén con carbón y virutas de madera. Encienda el carbón con cuidado de no prender las astillas. Cubra ambas cacerolas con papel de aluminio y deje que se ahumen durante 10-15 minutos, hasta conseguir el nivel de humo deseado, luego cúbralas con adobo y envuélvalas en papel de aluminio antes de meter las costillas en el horno a 300 grados durante 7 horas. Cuando las costillas se hayan enfriado, cuele la grasa y utilícela para la infusión.

Si le resulta difícil conseguir el mismo volumen de grasa, compense el resto con manteca de cerdo de un carnicero. Para obtener la misma profundidad de sabor sin las costillas, calienta la grasa en una olla con unas cucharadas de la marinada.

Una vez que tengas tu tarrina de grasa de cerdo sazonada en forma líquida enfriada, vierte cantidades iguales de mezcal Ilegal Joven y de grasa en un recipiente con cierre hermético. Séllelo, agítelo bien y métalo en el congelador toda la noche. Cuando todo esté separado y congelado, viértelo a través de un chino de malla fina. Si no tienes un chino, prueba con un colador de malla fina, o si no tienes uno de esos, prueba a quitar la mayor parte de la grasa con una cuchara. Quedarán algunas gotas de grasa anaranjada en el mezcal colado: pásalo por unas cuantas capas de estopilla (o filtros de café en su defecto) para deshacerte de lo que quede de ella.

El mezcal ya está listo para beber, solo o en cóctel.

Tintura de habanero

Corta los habaneros en rodajas y añade 2 onzas de mezcal Ilegal Joven.
Déjalo reposar toda la noche o hasta que alcance el nivel de picante deseado.
Cóctel

Mezcle el mezcal y el licor de chocolate en un vaso mezclador con hielo y remueva durante 45 segundos.
Colar en una copa fría.
Con cuidado, "hundir" el licor de café en el interior de la copa con una cuchara.
Decorar con 5 gotas de tintura de habanero.', '[{"name": "Mezcal", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Mezcal-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Chocolate liqueur", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Chocolate%20liqueur-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}, {"name": "Coffee liqueur", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Coffee%20liqueur-small.png", "measure": "1/2 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17247', 'The Last Word', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/91oule1513702624.jpg', NULL, 'Shake with ice and strain into a cocktail glass.', 'Agitar con hielo y colar en una copa de cóctel.', '[{"name": "Green Chartreuse", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Green%20Chartreuse-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Maraschino Liqueur", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Maraschino%20Liqueur-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17248', 'French Negroni', 'Cocktail', true, 'Martini Glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/x8lhp41513703167.jpg', NULL, 'Add ice to a shaker and pour in all ingredients.
Using a bar spoon, stir 40 to 45 revolutions or until thoroughly chilled.
Strain into a martini glass or over ice into a rocks glass. Garnish with orange twist.', 'Añada hielo a una coctelera y vierta todos los ingredientes.
Con una cuchara de bar, agitar de 40 a 45 revoluciones o hasta que esté bien frío.
Cuele en una copa de martini o sobre hielo en un vaso con hielo. Decorar con un twist de naranja.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Lillet", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lillet-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Sweet Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sweet%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Orange Peel", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Peel-small.png", "measure": "1"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17249', 'Pegu Club', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/jfkemm1513703902.jpg', NULL, 'Shake, strain, up, cocktail glass', 'Agitar, colar, levantar, copa de cóctel.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Orange Curacao", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Curacao-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}, {"name": "Angostura Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Angostura%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "1 dash"}, {"name": "Orange Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "1 dash"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17250', 'Corpse Reviver', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/gifgao1513704334.jpg', NULL, 'Shake, strain, straight up, cocktail glass rinsed with absinthe', 'Agitar, colar, derecho, copa de cóctel enjuagada con absenta', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}, {"name": "Triple Sec", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Triple%20Sec-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}, {"name": "Lillet Blanc", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lillet%20Blanc-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}, {"name": "Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}, {"name": "Absinthe", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Absinthe-small.png", "measure": "1 dash"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17252', 'Greyhound', 'Cocktail', true, 'Collins glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/g5upn41513706732.jpg', NULL, 'Add the vodka to a Collins glass filled with ice.
Top with grapefruit juice and stir.', 'Añada el vodka a un vaso Collins lleno de hielo.
Añada zumo de pomelo y remueva.', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Grapefruit Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grapefruit%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "3 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17253', 'Paloma', 'Cocktail', true, 'Collins glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/samm5j1513706393.jpg', NULL, 'Stir together and serve over ice.', 'Remover y servir con hielo.', '[{"name": "Grape Soda", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grape%20Soda-small.png", "measure": "3 oz"}, {"name": "Tequila", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tequila-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17254', 'Bijou', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/rysb3r1513706985.jpg', NULL, 'Stir in mixing glass with ice and strain', 'Remover en un vaso mezclador con hielo y colar', '[{"name": "Orange Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "1 dash"}, {"name": "Green Chartreuse", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Green%20Chartreuse-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Sweet Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sweet%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17255', 'Gimlet', 'Cocktail', true, 'Martini Glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/3xgldt1513707271.jpg', NULL, 'Add all the ingredients to a shaker and fill with ice.

