Decorar con una rueda de lima.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "2 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Sugar Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Lime", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime-small.png", "measure": "1"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17256', 'Martinez 2', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/fs6kiq1513708455.jpg', NULL, 'Add all ingredients to a mixing glass and fill with ice.

