Remover hasta que se enfríe y colar en una copa coupé fría.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Sweet Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sweet%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Maraschino Liqueur", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Maraschino%20Liqueur-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Angostura Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Angostura%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "2 dashes"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17266', 'Oatmeal Cookie', 'Cocktail', true, 'Mason jar', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/bsvmlg1515792693.jpg', NULL, 'Just mix it all together.
It''s meant to be a shot, but it works just fine as a proper adult-sized drink over lots of ice.

Tastes like an oatmeal cookie.', 'Simplemente mézclalo todo junto.
Está destinado a ser un trago, pero funciona bien como una bebida adecuada para adultos con mucho hielo.

Sabe a galleta de avena.', '[{"name": "Kahlua", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Kahlua-small.png", "measure": "2 parts"}, {"name": "Baileys irish cream", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Baileys%20irish%20cream-small.png", "measure": "2 parts"}, {"name": "Butterscotch schnapps", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Butterscotch%20schnapps-small.png", "measure": "4 parts"}, {"name": "Jagermeister", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Jagermeister-small.png", "measure": "1 part"}, {"name": "Goldschlager", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Goldschlager-small.png", "measure": "1/2 part"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17267', 'Bahama Mama', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/tyb4a41515793339.jpg', NULL, 'Add 2 parts club soda or more or less to taste.

