Mézclelo todo y viértalo sobre un montón de hielo. Bébelo con una pajita.', '[{"name": "Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rum-small.png", "measure": "3 parts"}, {"name": "Dark Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dark%20Rum-small.png", "measure": "1 part"}, {"name": "Banana liqueur", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Banana%20liqueur-small.png", "measure": "1 part"}, {"name": "Grenadine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grenadine-small.png", "measure": "1 part"}, {"name": "Pineapple Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Pineapple%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "2 parts"}, {"name": "Orange Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "2 parts"}, {"name": "Sweet and Sour", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sweet%20and%20Sour-small.png", "measure": "1 part"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17824', 'The Laverstoke', 'Cocktail', true, 'Balloon Glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/6xfj5t1517748412.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WKZOLJoDNZA', '1) Squeeze two lime wedges into a balloon glass then add the cordial, Bombay Sapphire and MARTINI Rosso Vermouth, swirl to mix.

2) Fully fill the glass with cubed ice and stir to chill.

3) Top with Fever-Tree Ginger Ale and gently stir again to combine.

4) Garnish with a snapped ginger slice and an awoken mint sprig.', '1) Exprima dos rodajas de lima en un vaso globo y luego agregue el cordial, Bombay Sapphire y MARTINI Rosso Vermouth y revuelva para mezclar.

2) Llene completamente el vaso con cubitos de hielo y revuelva para que se enfríe.

3) Cubra con Fever-Tree Ginger Ale y revuelva suavemente nuevamente para combinar.

4) Adorne con una rodaja de jengibre partida y una ramita de menta despierta.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "50 ml"}, {"name": "Elderflower cordial", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Elderflower%20cordial-small.png", "measure": "15 ml"}, {"name": "Rosso Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rosso%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "15 ml"}, {"name": "Tonic Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tonic%20Water-small.png", "measure": "75 ml"}, {"name": "Lime", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime-small.png", "measure": "2 Wedges"}, {"name": "Ginger", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ginger-small.png", "measure": "1 Slice"}, {"name": "Mint", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Mint-small.png", "measure": "1 Large Sprig"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17825', 'Brigadier', 'Cocktail', true, 'Coupe Glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/nl89tf1518947401.jpg', NULL, 'Mix ingredients in a warmed mug and stir.', 'Mezclar los ingredientes en una taza caliente y remover.', '[{"name": "Hot Chocolate", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Hot%20Chocolate-small.png", "measure": "4 oz"}, {"name": "Green Chartreuse", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Green%20Chartreuse-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Cherry Heering", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cherry%20Heering-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17826', 'The Jimmy Conway', 'Cocktail', true, 'Whiskey sour glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/wbcvyo1535794478.jpg', NULL, 'Fill glass with ice
Pour in The Irishman and Disaronno
Fill to the top with Cranberry Juice
Garnish with a slice of lemon…Enjoy!', 'Llena el vaso con hielo
Vierta El irlandés y Disaronno
Rellenar hasta arriba con jugo de arándano
Adorne con una rodaja de limón… ¡A disfrutar!', '[{"name": "Irish Whiskey", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Irish%20Whiskey-small.png", "measure": "50 ml"}, {"name": "Amaretto", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Amaretto-small.png", "measure": "50 ml"}, {"name": "Cranberry Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cranberry%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "4 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17827', 'Old Pal', 'Cocktail', true, 'Nick and Nora Glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/x03td31521761009.jpg', NULL, 'Chill cocktail glass. Add ingredients to a mixing glass, and fill 2/3 full with ice. Stir about 20 seconds. Empty cocktail glass and strain into the glass. Garnish with a twist of lemon peel.', 'Copa de cóctel fría. Agregue los ingredientes a un vaso mezclador y llénelo 2/3 de su capacidad con hielo. Revuelva unos 20 segundos. Vaciar la copa de cóctel y colar en la copa. Adorne con una rodaja de piel de limón.', '[{"name": "Rye whiskey", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rye%20whiskey-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Campari", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Campari-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Dry Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dry%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17828', 'Tipperary', 'Cocktail', true, 'Nick and Nora Glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/b522ek1521761610.jpg', NULL, 'Stir over ice. Strain into chilled glass. Cut a wide swath of orange peel, and express the orange oils over the drink. Discard orange twist.', 'Revuelva sobre hielo. Colar en vaso frío. Corta una franja amplia de cáscara de naranja y exprime los aceites de naranja sobre la bebida. Deseche la rodaja de naranja.', '[{"name": "Irish Whiskey", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Irish%20Whiskey-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Sweet Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sweet%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Green Chartreuse", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Green%20Chartreuse-small.png", "measure": "1/2 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17829', 'Penicillin', 'Cocktail', true, 'Old-fashioned glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/hc9b1a1521853096.jpg', NULL, 'Shake blended Scotch, lemon juice, honey syrup and ginger syrup with ice. Strain over large ice in chilled rocks glass. Float smoky Scotch on top (be sure to use a smoky Scotch such as an Islay single malt). Garnish with candied ginger.', 'Agitar con hielo la mezcla de whisky, zumo de limón, sirope de miel y sirope de jengibre. Colar sobre hielo grande en un vaso con hielo frío. Dejar flotar el whisky ahumado por encima (asegúrese de utilizar un whisky ahumado como un Islay single malt). Decorar con jengibre confitado.', '[{"name": "Blended Scotch", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Blended%20Scotch-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}, {"name": "Honey syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Honey%20syrup-small.png", "measure": "2 tsp"}, {"name": "Ginger Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ginger%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "2 tsp"}, {"name": "Islay single malt Scotch", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Islay%20single%20malt%20Scotch-small.png", "measure": "1/4 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17830', 'Corn n Oil', 'Cocktail', true, 'Old-fashioned glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/pk6dwi1592767243.jpg', NULL, 'Cut the half lime in half again. Add the lime, falernum, and bitters to a rocks glass. Muddle. Add the rum. (Aged Barbados rum such as Plantation 5 Year is recommended). Add ice and stir. Float the blackstrap rum on top. Serve with a straw.', 'Volver a cortar la media lima por la mitad. Añada la lima, el falernum y el amargo a un vaso con hielo. Mezcle. Añadir el ron. (Se recomienda ron añejo de Barbados, como Plantation 5 años). Añadir hielo y remover. Dejar flotar el ron blackstrap por encima. Servir con pajita.', '[{"name": "Lime", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime-small.png", "measure": "1/2"}, {"name": "Falernum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Falernum-small.png", "measure": "1/3 oz"}, {"name": "Angostura Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Angostura%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "2 dashes"}, {"name": "Añejo rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/A%C3%B1ejo%20rum-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "blackstrap rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/blackstrap%20rum-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17833', 'A. J.', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/l74qo91582480316.jpg', NULL, 'Shake ingredients with ice, strain into a cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Agitar los ingredientes con hielo, colar en una copa de cóctel y servir.', '[{"name": "Applejack", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Applejack-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Grapefruit juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grapefruit%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17835', 'Abilene', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/smb2oe1582479072.jpg', NULL, 'Pour all of the ingredients into a highball glass almost filled with ice cubes. Stir well.', 'Vierta todos los ingredientes en un vaso highball casi lleno de cubitos de hielo. Remover bien.', '[{"name": "Dark rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dark%20rum-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Peach nectar", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Peach%20nectar-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Orange juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20juice-small.png", "measure": "3 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17836', 'Acapulco', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Old-fashioned glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/il9e0r1582478841.jpg', NULL, 'Combine and shake all ingredients (except mint) with ice and strain into an old-fashioned glass over ice cubes. Add the sprig of mint and serve.', 'Mezclar y agitar todos los ingredientes (excepto la menta) con hielo y colar en un vaso old-fashioned sobre cubitos de hielo. Añada la ramita de menta y sirva.', '[{"name": "Light rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Light%20rum-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Triple sec", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Triple%20sec-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 tsp"}, {"name": "Lime juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1 tblsp"}, {"name": "Sugar", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Egg white", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Egg%20white-small.png", "measure": "1"}, {"name": "Mint", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Mint-small.png", "measure": "1"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17837', 'Adam', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{Alcoholic,Holiday}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/v0at4i1582478473.jpg', NULL, 'In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine all of the ingredients. Shake well. Strain into a cocktail glass.', 'En una coctelera llena hasta la mitad con cubitos de hielo, mezcle todos los ingredientes. Agitar bien. Colar en una copa de cóctel.', '[{"name": "Dark rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dark%20rum-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Lemon juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Grenadine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grenadine-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}]'::jsonb),
  ('17839', 'Affair', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/h5za6y1582477994.jpg', NULL, 'Pour schnapps, orange juice, and cranberry juice over ice in a highball glass. Top with club soda and serve.', 'Vierta el aguardiente, el zumo de naranja y el zumo de arándanos sobre hielo en un vaso alto. Añadir club soda y servir.', '[{"name": "Strawberry schnapps", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Strawberry%20schnapps-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Orange juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20juice-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Cranberry juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cranberry%20juice-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Club soda", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Club%20soda-small.png", "measure": null}]'::jsonb),
  ('17840', 'Affinity', 'Ordinary Drink', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/wzdtnn1582477684.jpg', NULL, 'In a mixing glass half-filled with ice cubes, combine all of the ingredients. Stir well. Strain into a cocktail glass.', 'En un vaso mezclador lleno hasta la mitad con cubitos de hielo, mezcle todos los ingredientes. Remover bien. Colar en una copa de cóctel.', '[{"name": "Scotch", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Scotch-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Sweet Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sweet%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Dry Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dry%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Orange bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20bitters-small.png", "measure": "2 dashes"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178307', 'Tequila Slammer', 'Shot', true, 'Hurricane glass', NULL, '{Drunk}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/43uhr51551451311.jpg', NULL, 'Mix carefully to avoid releasing the dissolved CO2.', 'Mezclar con cuidado para evitar que se libere el CO2 disuelto.', '[{"name": "Tequila", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tequila-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "7-up", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/7-up-small.png", "measure": "1 part"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178309', 'Espresso Rumtini', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{DinnerParty,StrongFlavor}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/acvf171561574403.jpg', NULL, 'Mix together in a cocktail glass. Garnish with some choclate powder and coffee beans', 'Mezclar todo en una copa de cóctel. Decorar con un poco de chocolate en polvo y granos de café.', '[{"name": "Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rum-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Vanilla syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vanilla%20syrup-small.png", "measure": "1/2 shot"}, {"name": "Espresso", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Espresso-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Coffee", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Coffee-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178310', 'Brooklyn', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{Alcoholic,Sweet,DateNight,USA}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/ojsezf1582477277.jpg', NULL, 'Combine ingredients with ice and stir until well-chilled. Strain into a chilled cocktail glass.', 'Mezclar los ingredientes con hielo y remover hasta que estén bien fríos. Cuele en una copa de cóctel fría.', '[{"name": "Rye Whiskey", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rye%20Whiskey-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Dry Vermouth", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dry%20Vermouth-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Maraschino Liqueur", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Maraschino%20Liqueur-small.png", "measure": "1/4 oz"}, {"name": "Angostura Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Angostura%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "3 dashes"}, {"name": "Maraschino Cherry", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Maraschino%20Cherry-small.png", "measure": "1"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178311', 'Broadside', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/l2o6xu1582476870.jpg', NULL, 'Half fill the glass with ice cubes. Crush the wormwood and add to ice. Pour rum, scotch and butters, then serve!', 'Llene el vaso hasta la mitad con cubitos de hielo. Machaque el ajenjo y añádalo al hielo. Vierta el ron, el whisky y las mantequillas, ¡y sírvalo!', '[{"name": "151 proof rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/151%20proof%20rum-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Scotch", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Scotch-small.png", "measure": "1/2 shot"}, {"name": "Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Bitters-small.png", "measure": "3 drops"}, {"name": "Wormwood", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Wormwood-small.png", "measure": "1 Fresh"}, {"name": "Ice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ice-small.png", "measure": "cubes"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178313', 'Halloween Punch', 'Punch / Party Drink', true, 'Punch bowl', NULL, '{Halloween}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/7hcgyj1571687671.jpg', NULL, 'Tip the cherry juice, orange peel, chilli, cinnamon sticks, cloves and ginger into a large saucepan. Simmer for 5 mins, then turn off the heat. Leave to cool, then chill for at least 4 hrs, or up to 2 days – the longer you leave it the more intense the flavours. If serving to young children, take the chilli out after a few hours.

When you’re ready to serve, pour the juice into a jug. Serve in glass bottles or glasses and pop a straw in each. If you''re adding vodka, do so at this stage. Dangle a fangs sweet from each glass.', 'Poner en un cazo grande el zumo de cereza, la piel de naranja, la guindilla, la canela en rama, el clavo y el jengibre. Cocer a fuego lento durante 5 minutos y apagar el fuego. Déjelo enfriar y póngalo a enfriar durante al menos 4 horas, o hasta 2 días; cuanto más tiempo lo deje, más intensos serán los sabores. Si se sirve a niños pequeños, retire la guindilla al cabo de unas horas.

Cuando esté listo para servir, vierta el zumo en una jarra. Sírvalo en botellas o vasos de cristal y coloque una pajita en cada uno. Si va a añadir vodka, hágalo en este momento. Cuelga un colmillo dulce de cada vaso.', '[{"name": "Cherry Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cherry%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1 bottle"}, {"name": "Orange Peel", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Peel-small.png", "measure": "3"}, {"name": "Red Chili Flakes", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Red%20Chili%20Flakes-small.png", "measure": "1"}, {"name": "Cloves", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cloves-small.png", "measure": "10"}, {"name": "Ginger", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ginger-small.png", "measure": "6"}, {"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "20 cl"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178315', 'Munich Mule', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{German}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/rj55pl1582476101.jpg', NULL, 'Fill glass with ice
Pour Gin and Lime Juice
Fill glass with Ginger Beer
Garnish with Cucumer and Lime slice', 'Llenar el vaso con hielo
Vierta la ginebra y el zumo de lima
Llenar el vaso con Ginger Beer
Decorar con pepino y rodaja de lima', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "5 cl"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "2 cl"}, {"name": "Ginger Beer", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ginger%20Beer-small.png", "measure": "10 cl"}, {"name": "Cucumber", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cucumber-small.png", "measure": "Chopped"}, {"name": "lemon", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/lemon-small.png", "measure": "Chopped"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178316', 'Honey Bee', 'Cocktail', true, 'Margarita glass', NULL, '{Sweet}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/vu8l7t1582475673.jpg', NULL, 'Shake ingredients with crushed ice', 'Agitar los ingredientes con hielo picado', '[{"name": "White Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/White%20Rum-small.png", "measure": "6 cl"}, {"name": "Honey", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Honey-small.png", "measure": "2 cl"}, {"name": "Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "2 cl"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178318', '747 Drink', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/i9suxb1582474926.jpg', NULL, 'Fill a Collins glass with ice.
Pour in vodka, lime cordial, and cranberry juice.
Fill up with Sprite.
Garnish with a Lime wheel or some cranberries', 'Llene un vaso Collins con hielo.
Vierta el vodka, el cordial de lima y el zumo de arándanos.
Rellene con Sprite.
Decorar con una rueda de lima o unos arándanos.', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Roses sweetened lime juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Roses%20sweetened%20lime%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Cranberry Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cranberry%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Sprite", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sprite-small.png", "measure": "Top"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178322', 'Spice 75', 'Cocktail', true, 'Wine Glass', NULL, '{Christmas}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/0108c41576797064.jpg', NULL, 'Gently warm 60g golden caster sugar in a pan with 30ml water and 1 tbsp allspice. Cook gently until the sugar has dissolved, then leave the mixture to cool. Strain through a sieve lined with a coffee filter (or a double layer of kitchen paper).

Pour 60ml of the spiced syrup into a cocktail shaker along with 200ml rum and 90ml lime juice. Shake with ice and strain between six flute glasses. Top up with 600ml champagne and garnish each with an orange twist.', 'Caliente suavemente 60 g de azúcar en polvo dorado en una cacerola con 30 ml de agua y 1 cucharada de pimienta de Jamaica. Cocine a fuego lento hasta que el azúcar se disuelva, luego deje enfriar la mezcla. Colar por un colador forrado con un filtro de café (o una doble capa de papel de cocina).

Vierta 60 ml del almíbar especiado en una coctelera junto con 200 ml de ron y 90 ml de zumo de lima. Agitar con hielo y colar entre seis vasos flauta. Complete con 600 ml de champán y decore cada uno con un toque de naranja.', '[{"name": "Sugar", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar-small.png", "measure": "60 ml"}, {"name": "Allspice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Allspice-small.png", "measure": "1 tblsp"}, {"name": "Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rum-small.png", "measure": "20 cl"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "90 ml"}, {"name": "Champagne", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Champagne-small.png", "measure": "6 cl"}, {"name": "Orange spiral", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20spiral-small.png", "measure": "Garnish with"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178323', 'Passion Fruit Martini', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/6trfve1582473527.jpg', NULL, 'Pour all ingredients into a glass and stir. Garnish with half a passion fruit piece.', 'Vierta todos los ingredientes en un vaso y revuelva. Adorne con medio trozo de maracuyá.', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Sugar Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "1/2 shot"}, {"name": "Passion fruit juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Passion%20fruit%20juice-small.png", "measure": "Full Glass"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178326', 'White Wine Sangria', 'Punch / Party Drink', true, 'Pitcher', NULL, '{Spanish}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/hnuod91587851576.jpg', NULL, 'Chop the Lemon, Lime and other fruits into large chunks. Fill the Pitcher with the white wine and mix in the Apple Brandy. Top to taste with soda water.', 'Picar el Limón, la Lima y las demás frutas en trozos grandes. Llenar la jarra con el vino blanco y mezclar con el Brandy de Manzana. Añada agua con gas al gusto.', '[{"name": "Lime", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime-small.png", "measure": "1"}, {"name": "lemon", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/lemon-small.png", "measure": "1"}, {"name": "White Wine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/White%20Wine-small.png", "measure": "750 ml"}, {"name": "Strawberries", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Strawberries-small.png", "measure": "1 cup"}, {"name": "Apple", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Apple-small.png", "measure": "1 cup"}, {"name": "Apple Brandy", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Apple%20Brandy-small.png", "measure": "3 shots"}, {"name": "Soda Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soda%20Water-small.png", "measure": "Top"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178327', 'Pineapple Paloma', 'Cocktail', true, 'Collins glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/pg8iw31593351601.jpg', NULL, 'Rub the rim of each glass with lime slice and dip into salt.
Add ice, tequila, grapefruit juice, lime juice and top with pineapple soda.
Give it a quick stir.
Garnish with fresh pineapple or lime.', 'Frote el borde de cada vaso con una rodaja de lima y sumérjalo en sal.
Añade hielo, tequila, zumo de pomelo, zumo de lima y completa con soda de piña.
Remover rápidamente.
Decorar con piña fresca o lima.', '[{"name": "Tequila", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tequila-small.png", "measure": "4 oz"}, {"name": "Grapefruit Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grapefruit%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "4 oz"}, {"name": "Fresh Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Fresh%20Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Pineapple Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Pineapple%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "8 oz"}, {"name": "Lime", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime-small.png", "measure": "Garnish with"}, {"name": "Pepper", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Pepper-small.png", "measure": "Rimmed"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178328', 'Funk and Soul', 'Cocktail', true, 'Collins glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/qtv83q1596015790.jpg', NULL, 'Mix all ingredients together and strain into a Collins glass. Use Jamaican rum where possible for a more authentic taste.', 'Mezcle todos los ingredientes y cuélelos en un vaso Collins. Utilice ron jamaicano siempre que sea posible para obtener un sabor más auténtico.', '[{"name": "Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rum-small.png", "measure": "2 shots"}, {"name": "Apricot Nectar", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Apricot%20Nectar-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Pomegranate juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Pomegranate%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "lemon", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/lemon-small.png", "measure": "Juice of 1/2"}, {"name": "Soda Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soda%20Water-small.png", "measure": "Top"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178330', 'The Philosopher', 'Cocktail', true, 'Margarita glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/sp8hkp1596017787.jpg', NULL, 'Add all the spirits in a shaker (best to use Hendricks gin) as well as the orange bitters and lemon juice. Strain into a Margarita glass, top with Prosecco.', 'Agrega todos los licores en una coctelera (es mejor usar ginebra Hendricks), así como el amargo de naranja y el jugo de limón. Colar en una copa Margarita y cubrir con Prosecco.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Melon Liqueur", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Melon%20Liqueur-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Orange Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "1 dash"}, {"name": "Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1 dash"}, {"name": "Prosecco", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Prosecco-small.png", "measure": "Top"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178333', 'Raspberry Julep', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cordial glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/hyztmx1598719265.jpg', NULL, 'Softly muddle the mint leaves and raspberry syrup in the bottom of the cup. Add crushed ice and Bourbon to the cup and then stir. Top with more ice, garnish with a mint sprig.', 'Triture suavemente las hojas de menta y el almíbar de frambuesa en el fondo de la taza. Agrega hielo picado y Bourbon a la taza y luego revuelve. Cubra con más hielo y decore con una ramita de menta.', '[{"name": "Bourbon", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Bourbon-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Raspberry syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Raspberry%20syrup-small.png", "measure": "1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Mint", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Mint-small.png", "measure": "8"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178334', 'Death in the Afternoon', 'Cocktail', true, 'Margarita glass', NULL, '{Drunk}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/y7s3rh1598719574.jpg', NULL, 'Easy as you like, pour the absinthe into a chilled glass, top with champagne. Must be drunk mid afternoon for the optimum effect.', 'Tan fácil como te apetezca, vierte la absenta en una copa helada y completa con champán. Debe beberse a media tarde para obtener un efecto óptimo.', '[{"name": "Absinthe", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Absinthe-small.png", "measure": "2 shots"}, {"name": "Champagne", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Champagne-small.png", "measure": "Top"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178335', 'Lazy Coconut Paloma', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{Lazy,Sharp}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/rytuex1598719770.jpg', NULL, 'Mix the coconut liqueur (preferably tequila) with the grapefruit juice and top with soda water. Garnish with a large grapefruit slice against the inside of the glass.', 'Mezclar el licor de coco (preferiblemente tequila) con el zumo de pomelo y completar con agua de soda. Decorar con una rodaja grande de pomelo en el interior del vaso.', '[{"name": "Coconut Liqueur", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Coconut%20Liqueur-small.png", "measure": "30 ml"}, {"name": "Grapefruit Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grapefruit%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "75 ml"}, {"name": "Soda Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soda%20Water-small.png", "measure": "Top"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178338', 'Pure Passion', 'Cocktail', true, 'Whiskey sour glass', NULL, '{Passion}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/4tymma1604179273.jpg', NULL, 'Mix up all ingredients with a cocktail stirrer and serve with crushed ice with mint and edible flour if available.', 'Mezcle todos los ingredientes con una coctelera y sirva con hielo picado con menta y harina comestible si está disponible.', '[{"name": "Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rum-small.png", "measure": "40 ml"}, {"name": "Passoa", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Passoa-small.png", "measure": "20 ml"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "30 ml"}, {"name": "Passion fruit syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Passion%20fruit%20syrup-small.png", "measure": "15 ml"}, {"name": "Peach Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Peach%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "Dash"}, {"name": "Mint", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Mint-small.png", "measure": "Garnish with"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178340', 'Garibaldi Negroni', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{Orange}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/kb4bjg1604179771.jpg', NULL, 'Mix together in a shaker and garnish with a simple orange slice. Fill your vitamin C and cocktail fix at the same time!', 'Mézclalo todo en una coctelera y adórnalo con una rodaja de naranja. ¡Llene su dosis de vitamina C y cóctel al mismo tiempo!', '[{"name": "Gin", "measure": "30 ml"}, {"name": "Campari", "measure": "30 ml"}, {"name": "Orange Juice", "measure": "90 ml"}, {"name": "Orange Peel", "measure": "Garnish with"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178341', 'Orange Rosemary Collins', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{Citrus}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/mokcas1604179977.jpg', NULL, 'Add the spirits to the bottom of the glass and top equally with the mixer drinks. Garnish with orange slices inside the glass as well as some rosemary on top.', 'Añada las bebidas espirituosas en el fondo del vaso y complete a partes iguales con las bebidas mezcladas. Adorne con rodajas de naranja en el interior del vaso y un poco de romero en la parte superior.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Orange Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "Top"}, {"name": "Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "Top"}, {"name": "Rosemary Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rosemary%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "25 ml"}, {"name": "Soda Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soda%20Water-small.png", "measure": "Top"}, {"name": "Rosemary", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rosemary-small.png", "measure": "Garnish with"}, {"name": "Orange Peel", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Peel-small.png", "measure": "Garnish with"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178342', 'Gin and Soda', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{Clear,Alcoholic}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/nzlyc81605905755.jpg', NULL, 'Pour the Gin and Soda water into a highball glass almost filled with ice cubes.
Stir well.
Garnish with the lime wedge.', 'Vierta la ginebra y el agua de soda en un vaso highball casi lleno de cubitos de hielo.
Remover bien.
Adorne con la rodaja de lima.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Soda Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soda%20Water-small.png", "measure": "5 oz"}, {"name": "Lime", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime-small.png", "measure": "1/4"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178343', 'Michelada', 'Cocktail', true, 'Pint glass', NULL, '{Hangover,StrongFlavor,Breakfast}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/u736bd1605907086.jpg', NULL, 'Mix the beer with tomato juice, freshly squeezed lime juice, and Worcestershire sauce, teriyaki sauce, soy sauce, or hot sauce.
Served In a chilled, salt-rimmed glass', 'Mezcle la cerveza con zumo de tomate, zumo de lima recién exprimido y salsa Worcestershire, salsa teriyaki, salsa de soja o salsa picante.
Se sirve en un vaso frío con borde de sal.', '[{"name": "Beer", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Beer-small.png", "measure": "4 oz"}, {"name": "Tomato Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tomato%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "4 oz"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1 tblsp"}, {"name": "Hot Sauce", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Hot%20Sauce-small.png", "measure": "Dash"}, {"name": "Worcestershire Sauce", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Worcestershire%20Sauce-small.png", "measure": "Dash"}, {"name": "Soy Sauce", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soy%20Sauce-small.png", "measure": "Dash"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178344', 'Figgy Thyme', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{Christmas,Sweet}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/pbw4e51606766578.jpg', NULL, 'In a lewis bag, crush up some ice like a baller/maniac (@glacioice). Pour your precious ice into a collins glass. In a cocktail shaker, muddle the figs and thyme together. Add honey vodka, lemon juice, and a large ice cube (@glacioice). Shake until well chilled, and strain into glass. Add tonic water and finally 2 dashes of angostura bitters. Garnish with sliced figs and thyme.', 'En una bolsa lewis, tritura un poco de hielo como un baller/maníaco (@glacioice). Vierte tu preciado hielo en un vaso Collins. En una coctelera, mezcla los higos y el tomillo. Añade el vodka de miel, el zumo de limón y un cubito de hielo grande (@glacioice). Agitar hasta que esté bien frío y colar en el vaso. Añadir agua tónica y, por último, 2 chorritos de amargo de angostura. Decorar con rodajas de higo y tomillo.', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Honey", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Honey-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Figs", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Figs-small.png", "measure": "3"}, {"name": "Thyme", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Thyme-small.png", "measure": "1 Sprig"}, {"name": "Angostura Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Angostura%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "2 dashes"}, {"name": "Tonic Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tonic%20Water-small.png", "measure": "Top"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178345', 'Hot Toddy', 'Cocktail', true, 'Irish coffee cup', NULL, '{Winter}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/ggx0lv1613942306.jpg', NULL, 'STEP 1
Whisk the whisky and honey together and split between 2 heatproof glasses. Add half of the cinnamon stick to each, then top up with 200ml boiling water.

STEP 2
Add a splash of lemon juice to each, then taste and add more to your preference. Finish each with a slice of lemon, studded with a clove, and serve immediately.', 'PASO 1
Bata el whisky y la miel y repártalos en 2 vasos refractarios. Añada la mitad de la rama de canela a cada uno y, a continuación, añada 200 ml de agua hirviendo.

PASO 2
Añada un chorrito de zumo de limón a cada vaso, pruébelo y añada el zumo que prefiera. Termine cada uno con una rodaja de limón, salpicada con un clavo, y sirva inmediatamente.', '[{"name": "Whiskey", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Whiskey-small.png", "measure": "50 ml"}, {"name": "Honey", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Honey-small.png", "measure": "15 ml"}, {"name": "Cinnamon", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cinnamon-small.png", "measure": "1"}, {"name": "lemon", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/lemon-small.png", "measure": "1"}, {"name": "Cloves", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cloves-small.png", "measure": "2"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178346', 'Elderflower Caipirinha', 'Cocktail', true, 'Collins glass', NULL, '{Brazilian}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/dif7a31614006331.jpg', NULL, 'Take the glass and muddle the lime in it. Fill the glass with crushed ice and add the Cachaca. Stir well and top with some more crushed ice. Garnish with lime and enjoy!', 'Coge el vaso y machaca la lima en él. Llene el vaso con hielo picado y añada la cachaca. Remueve bien y añade más hielo picado. Decóralo con lima y ¡a disfrutar!', '[{"name": "Cachaca", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cachaca-small.png", "measure": "60 ml"}, {"name": "Lime", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime-small.png", "measure": "1"}, {"name": "Elderflower cordial", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Elderflower%20cordial-small.png", "measure": "3 cl"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178347', 'Winter Rita', 'Beer', true, 'Highball Glass', NULL, '{Winter}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/fwpd0v1614006733.jpg', NULL, 'Salt rim. Combine all ingredients, shake with ice, and strain over fresh ice.⠀', 'Borde de sal. Combine todos los ingredientes, agite con hielo y cuele sobre hielo fresco.⠀', '[{"name": "Tequila", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tequila-small.png", "measure": "1 2/3 oz"}, {"name": "Campari", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Campari-small.png", "measure": "1/4 oz"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "3/4 oz"}, {"name": "Orange Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Rosemary Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rosemary%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Salt", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Salt-small.png", "measure": "Dash"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178348', 'Winter Paloma', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{Winter}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/u5f0pz1614007748.jpg', NULL, 'Everyone’s favourite Paloma gets a delicious Indian makeover. Tequila reposado infused with “Timur Pepper” which has citrusy & grapefruit notes and is grown at the foothills of Himalaya. It also produces a slightly numbing and tingling sensation on your lip when consumed. We have also spiced up the fresh grapefruit juice with the warming spice blend from Himalaya. The combination of all these interesting elements has allowed us to elevate your Paloma sipping experience.', 'La Paloma favorita de todos recibe un delicioso cambio de imagen indio. Tequila reposado infundido con "Timur Pepper", que tiene notas cítricas y de pomelo y se cultiva en las estribaciones del Himalaya. También produce una ligera sensación de entumecimiento y hormigueo en el labio cuando se consume. También hemos condimentado el zumo de pomelo fresco con la cálida mezcla de especias del Himalaya. La combinación de todos estos elementos interesantes nos ha permitido mejorar su experiencia al beber Paloma.', '[{"name": "Tequila", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tequila-small.png", "measure": "2 shots"}, {"name": "Grapefruit Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grapefruit%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "Top"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "Juice of 1"}, {"name": "Agave Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Agave%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Pepper", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Pepper-small.png", "measure": "Dash"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178349', 'Snowday', 'Cocktail', true, 'Collins glass', NULL, '{Winter}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/4n1ipk1614009624.jpg', NULL, 'Stir all ingredients with ice. Strain into a chilled rocks glass over fresh ice. Express orange peel over drink and garnish.', 'Remover todos los ingredientes con hielo. Colar en un vaso con hielo fresco. Exprima la piel de naranja sobre la bebida y decore.', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Amaro Montenegro", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Amaro%20Montenegro-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Ruby Port", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ruby%20Port-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Blood Orange", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Blood%20Orange-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Angostura Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Angostura%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "Dash"}, {"name": "Orange Peel", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Peel-small.png", "measure": "Garnish with"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178350', 'The Galah', 'Cocktail', true, 'Collins glass', NULL, '{Dark}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/sy7y6r1614775067.jpg', NULL, 'Mix together the alcoholic portions and top with Pineapple and Lime juice.', 'Mezclar las porciones alcohólicas y cubrir con el zumo de piña y lima.', '[{"name": "Dark Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dark%20Rum-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Campari", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Campari-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Creme De Banane", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Creme%20De%20Banane-small.png", "measure": "1/2 shot"}, {"name": "Pineapple Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Pineapple%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "Top"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "Top"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178352', 'Frosé', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{Cold,Frozen,Summer}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/b4cadp1619695347.jpg', NULL, 'Step 1
Pour rosé into a 13x9" pan and freeze until almost solid (it won''t completely solidify due to the alcohol), at least 6 hours.

Step 2
Meanwhile, bring sugar and ½ cup water to a boil in a medium saucepan; cook, stirring constantly, until sugar dissolves, about 3 minutes. Add strawberries, remove from heat, and let sit 30 minutes to infuse syrup with strawberry flavor. Strain through a fine-mesh sieve into a small bowl (do not press on solids); cover and chill until cold, about 30 minutes.

Step 3
Scrape rosé into a blender. Add lemon juice, 3½ ounces strawberry syrup, and 1 cup crushed ice and purée until smooth. Transfer blender jar to freezer and freeze until frosé is thickened (aim for milkshake consistency), 25–35 minutes.

Step 4
Blend again until frosé is slushy. Divide among glasses.

Step 5
Do Ahead: Rosé can be frozen 1 week ahead.', 'Paso 1
Vierta el rosado en un molde de 13x9" y congélelo hasta que esté casi sólido (no se solidificará completamente debido al alcohol), al menos 6 horas.

Paso 2
Mientras tanto, ponga a hervir el azúcar y ½ taza de agua en un cazo mediano; cocine, removiendo constantemente, hasta que el azúcar se disuelva, unos 3 minutos. Añada las fresas, retire del fuego y deje reposar 30 minutos para que el sirope adquiera el sabor a fresa. Páselo por un colador de malla fina a un bol pequeño (no presione los sólidos); cúbralo y refrigérelo hasta que se enfríe, unos 30 minutos.

Paso 3
Pasar el rosado a una batidora. Añadir el zumo de limón, 3½ onzas de sirope de fresa y 1 taza de hielo picado y triturar hasta obtener una mezcla homogénea. Pasar la jarra de la batidora al congelador y congelar hasta que el frosé esté espeso (para que tenga consistencia de batido), entre 25 y 35 minutos.

Paso 4
Volver a batir hasta que el frosé esté espumoso. Repartir en vasos.

Paso 5
Prepáralo: El rosado se puede congelar con 1 semana de antelación.', '[{"name": "Rose", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Rose-small.png", "measure": "750 ml"}, {"name": "Sugar", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar-small.png", "measure": "1/2 cup"}, {"name": "Strawberries", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Strawberries-small.png", "measure": "8 oz"}, {"name": "Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "2-3 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178354', 'Pink Moon', 'Cocktail', true, 'Whiskey Glass', NULL, '{Fresh,Summer,Colourful,Nature}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/lnjoc81619696191.jpg', NULL, 'Slowly shake in a shaker with ice, strain into a square whiskey glass. Top with fresh ice. Add the blackberries to garnish. Add flowers and a green leaf for a special look!', 'Agitar lentamente en una coctelera con hielo, colar en un vaso cuadrado de whisky. Cubrir con hielo fresco. Añadir las moras para adornar. Añada flores y una hoja verde para darle un toque especial.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Coconut Liqueur", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Coconut%20Liqueur-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Elderflower cordial", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Elderflower%20cordial-small.png", "measure": "25 ml"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "30 ml"}, {"name": "Blackberries", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Blackberries-small.png", "measure": "Garnish with"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178357', 'Pornstar Martini', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{Adult,Shot,Bubbly}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/xjhjdf1630406071.jpg', NULL, 'Straight: Pour all ingredients into mixing glass with ice cubes. Shake well. Strain in chilled martini cocktail glass. Cut passion fruit in half and use as garnish. Pour prosecco into a chilled shot glass and serve alongside the martini.', 'Directo: Vierta todos los ingredientes en un vaso mezclador con cubitos de hielo. Agite bien. Colar en una copa de cóctel de martini fría. Corta la maracuyá por la mitad y úsala como guarnición. Vierta el prosecco en un vaso de chupito frío y sírvalo junto con el martini.', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "3 cl"}, {"name": "Passoa", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Passoa-small.png", "measure": "3 cl"}, {"name": "Passion fruit juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Passion%20fruit%20juice-small.png", "measure": "1 cl"}, {"name": "Lime", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime-small.png", "measure": "1 cl"}, {"name": "Prosecco", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Prosecco-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178358', 'Mango Mojito', 'Cocktail', true, 'Jar', NULL, '{Fruity}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/wfqmgm1630406820.jpg', NULL, 'Squeeze the juice from 1½ limes and blend with the mango to give a smooth purée.
Cut the rest of the limes into quarters, and then cut each wedge in half again. Put 2 pieces of lime in a highball glass for each person and add 1 teaspoon of caster sugar and 5-6 mint leaves to each glass. Squish everything together with a muddler or the end of a rolling pin to release all the flavours from the lime and mint.
Divide the mango purée between the glasses and add 30ml white rum and a handful of crushed ice to each one, stirring well to mix everything together. Top up with soda water to serve and garnish with extra mint, if you like.', 'Exprimir el zumo de 1½ limas y mezclarlo con el mango para obtener un puré suave.
Corte el resto de las limas en cuartos y, a continuación, vuelva a cortar cada gajo por la mitad. Ponga 2 trozos de lima en un vaso alto para cada persona y añada 1 cucharadita de azúcar glas y 5-6 hojas de menta a cada vaso. Aplástelo todo con un batidor o con la punta de un rodillo para liberar todos los sabores de la lima y la menta.
Divida el puré de mango entre los vasos y añada 30 ml de ron blanco y un puñado de hielo picado a cada uno, removiendo bien para mezclarlo todo. Completar con agua con gas para servir y decorar con más menta, si se desea.', '[{"name": "Lime", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime-small.png", "measure": "3"}, {"name": "Mango", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Mango-small.png", "measure": "1 Fresh"}, {"name": "Mint", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Mint-small.png", "measure": "Sprig"}, {"name": "White Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/White%20Rum-small.png", "measure": "200 ml"}, {"name": "Ice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ice-small.png", "measure": "cubes"}, {"name": "Soda Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soda%20Water-small.png", "measure": "Top"}, {"name": "Mango", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Mango-small.png", "measure": "Garnish with"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178359', 'Kiwi Martini', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{Green,Sharp}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/bmxmyq1630407098.jpg', NULL, 'The kiwi martini is a very fun vodka cocktail and it is one of the best drinks that makes use of fresh fruit. Though there are a few recipes floating around, this is one of the easiest and it is an absolutely delightful green martini to drink.

For this recipe, you''ll simply muddle slices of kiwi with simple syrup, then shake it with vodka. It''s a drink that anyone can mix up in minutes and a perfect cocktail to show off your favorite vodka.', 'El martini de kiwi es un cóctel de vodka muy divertido y una de las mejores bebidas que utilizan fruta fresca. Aunque hay algunas recetas circulando por ahí, esta es una de las más fáciles y es un martini verde absolutamente delicioso de beber.

Para esta receta, basta con mezclar rodajas de kiwi con sirope simple y agitarlo con vodka. Es una bebida que cualquiera puede preparar en minutos y un cóctel perfecto para presumir de tu vodka favorito.', '[{"name": "Kiwi", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Kiwi-small.png", "measure": "1/2"}, {"name": "Sugar Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "1 tsp"}, {"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 oz"}, {"name": "Kiwi", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Kiwi-small.png", "measure": "Garnish with"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178360', 'Lemon Elderflower Spritzer', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{Summer,Fresh,Refreshing}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/125w0o1630407389.jpg', NULL, 'Pour all ingredients over ice, stir and enjoy!', 'Vierte todos los ingredientes sobre hielo, remueve y ¡a disfrutar!', '[{"name": "Elderflower cordial", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Elderflower%20cordial-small.png", "measure": "2 tsp"}, {"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "1 shot"}, {"name": "Soda Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soda%20Water-small.png", "measure": "1/3 cup"}, {"name": "Fresh Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Fresh%20Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "Top"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178362', 'Vodka Slime', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/apex461643588115.jpg', NULL, 'Fill glass with ice. Add vodka, 7-up then finish with the lime juice.', 'Llene el vaso con hielo. Añada el vodka, el 7-up y termine con el zumo de lima.', '[{"name": "Sprite", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sprite-small.png", "measure": "1 cup"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1/2 shot"}, {"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 shot"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178363', 'Vodka Lemon', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/mql55h1643820632.jpg', NULL, 'The vodka lemon is prepared directly in a highball glass or in a large tumbler: put 6-7 ice cubes in the glass, pour the vodka, lemonade and mix with a bar spoon. Finally decorate with a slice of lemon and, if you prefer, add a few mint leaves. Your vodka lemon is ready to be served.', 'El vodka limón se prepara directamente en un vaso highball o en un vaso grande: pon 6-7 cubitos de hielo en el vaso, vierte el vodka, la limonada y mezcla con una cuchara de bar. Por último, decore con una rodaja de limón y, si lo prefiere, añada unas hojas de menta. Tu vodka limón está listo para servir.', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "5 cl"}, {"name": "Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "7 cl"}, {"name": "Lemon Peel", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Peel-small.png", "measure": "1 Slice"}, {"name": "Ice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ice-small.png", "measure": "cubes"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178364', 'Vodka Tonic', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/9koz3f1643821062.jpg', NULL, 'Wash and cut 1 wedge and 1 slice of lime or lemon.
Fill a tumbler with fresh ice.
Pour the desired dose of vodka and top up with the tonic.
Squeeze the lime wedge into the glass and decorate with the slice.
That''s all, very simple: it''s just the recipe for happiness!', 'Lavar y cortar 1 gajo y 1 rodaja de lima o limón.
Llenar un vaso con hielo fresco.
Vierta la dosis deseada de vodka y complete con la tónica.
Exprima la rodaja de lima en el vaso y decore con la rodaja.
Eso es todo, muy sencillo: ¡es la receta de la felicidad!', '[{"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "4 cl"}, {"name": "Tonic Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tonic%20Water-small.png", "measure": "10 cl"}, {"name": "Lemon Peel", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Peel-small.png", "measure": "1 Slice"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178365', 'Gin Tonic', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/qcgz0t1643821443.jpg', NULL, 'Fill a highball glass with ice, pour the gin, top with tonic water and squeeze a lemon wedge and garnish with a lemon wedge.', 'Llenar un vaso highball con hielo, verter la ginebra, completar con agua tónica y exprimir una rodaja de limón y decorar con una rodaja de limón.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "4 cl"}, {"name": "Tonic Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tonic%20Water-small.png", "measure": "10 cl"}, {"name": "Lemon Peel", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Peel-small.png", "measure": "1 Slice"}, {"name": "Ice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ice-small.png", "measure": "cubes"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178366', 'Gin Lemon', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{simple,classic,refreshing}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/6gdohq1681212476.jpg', NULL, 'For the preparation of the gin lemon you will not need the shaker. Fill the tumbler with ice, pour the gin and lemonade over it. Gently mix and decorate with a slice of lemon. Those who prefer can also add a few mint leaves. Your gin lemon is ready to be served.', 'Para la preparación del gin lemon no necesitarás la coctelera. Llene el vaso con hielo, vierta la ginebra y la limonada por encima. Mezcle suavemente y decore con una rodaja de limón. Los que lo prefieran también pueden añadir unas hojas de menta. Su gin lemon está listo para servir.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "6 cl"}, {"name": "Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "8 cl"}, {"name": "Lemon Peel", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Peel-small.png", "measure": "1 Slice"}, {"name": "Ice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ice-small.png", "measure": "cubes"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178367', 'Ramos Gin Fizz', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/967t911643844053.jpg', NULL, 'Prepare all the ingredients on the counter to be able to work well and quickly, especially the cream and egg white.

Pour all the ingredients into a shaker.

Shake vigorously for 1 minute: cream and egg white must be mixed perfectly, so don''t rush.

Now open the shaker and put some ice and shake for 1-2 minutes. It depends on how long you can resist!

Pour into a highball glass, add a splash of soda and garnish to taste.

Ramos Gin Fizz was once drunk as an invigorating drink or even as a breakfast, try it as an aperitif and after dinner and you will discover a little gem now lost.', 'Preparar todos los ingredientes en la encimera para poder trabajar bien y rápido, especialmente la nata y la clara de huevo.

Vierta todos los ingredientes en una coctelera.

Agita enérgicamente durante 1 minuto: la nata y la clara de huevo deben mezclarse perfectamente, así que no tengas prisa.

Ahora abre la coctelera, pon un poco de hielo y agita durante 1-2 minutos. Depende de cuánto tiempo puedas resistir.

Vierte en un vaso highball, añade un chorrito de soda y adorna al gusto.

El Gin Fizz de Ramos se tomaba antiguamente como bebida tonificante o incluso como desayuno, pruébelo como aperitivo y después de cenar y descubrirá una pequeña joya hoy perdida.', '[{"name": "Gin", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Gin-small.png", "measure": "4.5 cL"}, {"name": "Lemon Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lemon%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "3 cl"}, {"name": "Sugar Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "3 cl"}, {"name": "Cream", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Cream-small.png", "measure": "6 cl"}, {"name": "Egg White", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Egg%20White-small.png", "measure": "1"}, {"name": "Vanilla extract", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vanilla%20extract-small.png", "measure": "2 drop"}, {"name": "Soda Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Soda%20Water-small.png", "measure": "2 cl"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178368', 'Planter’s Punch', 'Cocktail', true, 'Highball glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/jn6o251643844541.jpg', NULL, 'Squeeze an orange and strain the juice. Put all the ingredients in a shaker filled with ice and shake for at least 12 seconds. Strain into a highball glass and decorate with a pineapple wedge or fruit of your choice.', 'Exprimir una naranja y colar el zumo. Poner todos los ingredientes en una coctelera con hielo y agitar durante al menos 12 segundos. Cuélalo en un vaso highball y decóralo con un trozo de piña o la fruta que prefieras.', '[{"name": "Dark Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Dark%20Rum-small.png", "measure": "4.5 cL"}, {"name": "Orange Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orange%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "3 cl"}, {"name": "Pineapple Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Pineapple%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "3.5 cl"}, {"name": "Grenadine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grenadine-small.png", "measure": "1 cl"}, {"name": "Sugar Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "1 cl"}, {"name": "Angostura Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Angostura%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "4 drops"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178370', 'Mauresque', 'Cocktail', true, 'Collins glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/duwfa11686236556.jpg', NULL, '1 - Pour the Ricard (or pastis)
2 - Pour the orgeat syrup
3 - Finally pour the water and add ice cubes at your convenience.

Add the ice cubes at the end, otherwise the syrup and pastis do not mix well.', '1 - Vierta el Ricard (o pastis)
2 - Vierta el sirope de orgeat
3 - Por último, vierta el agua y añada cubitos de hielo a su gusto.

Añada los cubitos de hielo al final, de lo contrario el sirope y el pastis no se mezclan bien.', '[{"name": "Ricard", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Ricard-small.png", "measure": "3 cl"}, {"name": "Orgeat Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Orgeat%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "1 cl"}, {"name": "Water", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Water-small.png", "measure": "Full Glass"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178371', 'Old Cuban', 'Cocktail', true, 'Cocktail glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/eo8gfx1699022995.jpg', NULL, 'Shake a handful of mint, 2oz white rum, 1oz of sugar syrup, 1oz lime juice and 2 dashes angostura bitters with ice. Double strain into a glass and top with 2oz of prosecco.', 'Agite con hielo un puñado de menta, 2 onzas de ron blanco, 1 onza de sirope de azúcar, 1 onza de zumo de lima y 2 chorritos de amargo de angostura. Cuele dos veces en un vaso y añada 2 onzas de prosecco.', '[{"name": "White Rum", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/White%20Rum-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}, {"name": "Sugar Syrup", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Sugar%20Syrup-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Lime Juice", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Lime%20Juice-small.png", "measure": "1 oz"}, {"name": "Angostura Bitters", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Angostura%20Bitters-small.png", "measure": "2 dashes"}, {"name": "Prosecco", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Prosecco-small.png", "measure": "2 oz"}]'::jsonb),
  ('178372', 'Boyarsky', 'Shot', true, 'Shot glass', NULL, '{}'::text[], 'https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/media/drink/o9m9wy1790013164.jpg', NULL, 'Pour a layer of vodka over the grenadine, then add a few drops of Tabasco sauce.', NULL, '[{"name": "Grenadine", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Grenadine-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 shot"}, {"name": "Vodka", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Vodka-small.png", "measure": "1 1/2 shot"}, {"name": "Tabasco Sauce", "image": "https://www.thecocktaildb.com/images/ingredients/Tabasco%20Sauce-small.png", "measure": "5 drops"}]'::jsonb)
